error: test.tsx:2:6: `<Box>` cannot use `_ios` on React Native: `_ios` takes an object of styles. Fix: write the styles in an object, such as `_ios={{ p: 2 }}`
test.tsx:2:32: `<Box>` cannot use `...` on React Native: the build reads only the styles written in a block. Fix: write each style in the block
